"lantern_body_four" = "They hung the lantern outside together. Down in the valley, the first train rounded the bend. Its driver sounded the horn, and a hundred windows caught the little light. The station was no longer the end of the line.";
"lantern_body_one" = "Every autumn, Leo lit the lanterns along the mountain railway. This year one stayed dark. He found it at the last station, beside a letter addressed simply to whoever comes this far.";
"lantern_body_three" = "He reached the house just before dawn. In its window sat an old railway clock, stopped at seven. A woman opened the door with two cups of tea. She had kept the kettle warm all night.";
"lantern_body_two" = "The letter contained a match and a drawing of a house beyond the ridge. Leo filled the lantern, buttoned his coat, and stepped off the platform. Above him, the first snow moved between the stars.";
